    "must every truck complete its route (return to the depot) by time 1236, or is 1236 just the latest time a truck may depart from the depot?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy clarification regarding the meaning of the time limit 1236 (return deadline vs. departure deadline)."
}

{
  "action": "question",
